---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What information Toolwise AI collects and how it is used.">
  <Prose title="Privacy policy" lede="What information this site collects, and what it doesn’t.">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      Toolwise AI does not currently use analytics, advertising trackers or cookies of its own, and the site has no
      account sign-up or forms.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on Netlify. Like most web hosts, Netlify may process standard technical information (such as
      IP address, browser type and the pages requested) to deliver and secure the site. See
      <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener">Netlify’s privacy policy</a> for details.
    </p>
    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      Articles link to third-party websites, including tool vendors and, where disclosed, affiliate partners. Those
      sites have their own privacy practices, which we don’t control.
    </p>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we add analytics, advertising or other services that process personal data, we will update this page before
      doing so and, where required, ask for your consent.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
